

**16.38. Expression as Infinite Series**

Let \(v\)=\(\pi u/(2K)\)

**16.38.1**

\[\vartheta_{s}(u)=\left[\frac{2\pi q^{Uz}}{m^{V_{1}}m_{1}^{*}lK}\right]^{1/2}\sum \limits_{n=0}^{\infty}\;(-1)^{n}q^{n(n+1)}\sin\,(2n+1)v\]

**16.38.2**

\[\vartheta_{c}(u)=\left[\frac{2\pi q^{Uz}}{m^{V_{2}}lK}\right]^{1/2}\sum\limits _{n=0}^{\infty}\;q^{n(n+1)}\cos\,(2n+1)v\]

**16.38.3**

\[\vartheta_{d}(u)=\left[\frac{\pi}{2K}\right]^{1/2}\left\{1+2\sum\limits_{n=1}^{ \infty}q^{n^{2}}\cos\,2nv\right\}.\]

**16.38.4**

\[\vartheta_{s}(u)=\left[\frac{\pi}{2m^{V_{1}}lK}\right]^{1/2}\left\{1+2\sum \limits_{n=1}^{\infty}\;(-1)^{n}q^{n^{2}}\cos\,2nv\right\}\]

**16.38.5**

\[(2K/\pi)^{1/2}=1+2q+2q^{4}+2q^{4}+\ldots\,.=\vartheta_{3}(0,\,q)\]

